Place a TrueType font file here named DejaVuSans.ttf (or any .ttf).
The game will load it for star system name labels at Close zoom.

If no font file is present, system names fall back to SDL3's built-in
8x8 bitmap debug font automatically — no action is required.

DejaVu Sans is freely available at https://dejavu-fonts.github.io/
(Bitstream Vera Fonts Copyright, no restrictions on redistribution).
